e="html">The budget for 2027 has reached new highs, and pension funds, defense spending and a weak economy are increasing the pressure. At the same time, tensions are mounting within the government.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>US Army detonates unstable lead-based explosives in Iowa</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d8b62ba9bc9ca9b622e3080fc4f38d18241f32a3948d283da1a959bcdf467b15</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:43:36Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T15:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-army-detonates-unstable-lead-based-explosives-in-iowa/a-80043319--c4804e3d6ed1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-army-detonates-unstable-lead-based-explosives-in-iowa/a-80043319?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US Army says a controlled blast is the safest way to deal with explosive chemicals that began crystallizing in storage. US President Donald Trump said "mitigation efforts have far exceeded expectations."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>EU must set out a new timeline for cage-free farming, court rules</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ceb8fde18d3732881331a6527af559ed4a71d32dc16fdbafd79f73976fe1e962</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:43:40Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T15:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-must-set-out-a-new-timeline-for-cage-free-farming-court-rules/a-80051729--5055be48cf6e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-must-set-out-a-new-timeline-for-cage-free-farming-court-rules/a-80051729?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">European General Court ruled that the European Commission has failed to set out a timeline after pledging to end caged farming by the end of 2023.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nigeria's upcoming election marred by rising AI disinformation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:73e115da96d191261040ede358e24d0ac0a2822b7f378ed5b8ac5c2e88fdf873</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:42:33Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T15:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nigeria-s-upcoming-election-marred-by-rising-ai-disinformation/a-79946897--e1618bd315dd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-s-upcoming-election-marred-by-rising-ai-disinformation/a-79946897?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As Nigeria inches closer to the 2027 polls, the use of artificial intelligence in the electoral process has prompted questions about integrity and institutional readiness. Can Nigerians trust their democratic processes?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine: Poland to set up no-fly zone near Ukraine border</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c0941931dd4f24fa5da22aea2b4eb10d2a4a6776b8aae99fddddf666934ae50b</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:43:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T14:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-poland-to-set-up-no-fly-zone-near-ukraine-border/live-80047122--a9b171e10de2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-poland-to-set-up-no-fly-zone-near-ukraine-border/live-80047122?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Poland urged NATO allies to be vigilant at their borders after repeated Russian airspace incursions. Allies have also offered different opinions on Kyiv attacking Russian ships in Libya. Follow DW for the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US plans new tariffs on EU, China and 12 others</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:992da0c250b8eaf6e2d4e4ba5df262a5cb67a565f2f9e5997fb0fff13d4d94c1</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:43:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T14:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-plans-new-tariffs-on-eu-china-and-12-others/a-80050872--4aaf71a33ac8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-plans-new-tariffs-on-eu-china-and-12-others/a-80050872?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Trump administration is planning new import duties of up to 20% to counter excessive manufacturing abroad. The measures could put further pressure on US consumers already struggling with high living costs.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>German firms eye Africa as global trade shocks hit traditional markets</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:06be48e2566e622a3005236c9a73937f10d94a5b26a3a0c53f0b1bb142317147</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:43:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T14:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-firms-eye-africa-as-global-trade-shocks-hit-traditional-markets/a-80047671--b64160bb0ab9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-firms-eye-africa-as-global-trade-shocks-hit-traditional-markets/a-80047671?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">German businesses are optimistic about Africa, but Berlin's cautious approach to risk is holding them back from cashing in on the opportunities that their competitors from countries like the UAE and Turkey are seizing.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>EU plans €50 billion sovereign tech equity fund to boost quantum technology</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:14b5a2277031cef1de0b12fe6ac36a2d88060ad99765cefe9e14310c15b799f7</id><updated>2026-11-25T18:43:52Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T13:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-plans-_50-billion-sovereign-tech-equity-fund-to-boost-quantum-technology/a-80047569--2429dd24f928.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-plans-€50-billion-sovereign-tech-equity-fund-to-boost-quantum-technology/a-80047569?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The European Commission proposed a tech fund with a target size of €50 billion to boost 